name: sim.getJointTargetVelocity
description: Retrieves the target linear/angular velocity of a non-spherical joint
luaSynopsis: float targetVelocity = sim.getJointTargetVelocity(int objectHandle)
pythonSynopsis: float targetVelocity = sim.getJointTargetVelocity(int objectHandle)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: handle of the joint object
outputs:
1. targetVelocity: target velocity of the joint.
replacedBy:
- name: targetVelocity, class: joint, file: joint_targetVelocity.property
